      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "Use this function when attempting to fit the presentation size of a player item object’s content within the bounds of another [`CALayer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/QuartzCore/CALayer).",
      "ko": "이 속성은 화이트 밸런스에 사용되는 현재 빨간색, 초록색, 파란색 게인 값을 지정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "10386b930f6b52f059506eb33e475c27799e2105dabd1272b124bb87b1faf5ff",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "Use the returned [`CGRect`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGRect) as the player layer’s [`frame`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/QuartzCore/CALayer/frame) property value.",
      "ko": "이 값을 사용하여 특정 장면의 색상 캐스트를 조정할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "773e3fb7d32f833796524a99f66de93d5957aece14ee364d2d26a3ec9d4efd5e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0003",
      "source": "For example:",
      "ko": "For example:",
      "sourceHash": "652744a2ab28954bbafd780fd76c15c2bd557594532f907f10ead1989727af95",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "**Swift**:",
      "ko": "각 채널은 `1.0`에서 -[`maxWhiteBalanceGain`](avcapturedevice/maxwhitebalancegain.md)까지의 값을 지원합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "53d16fadeeea2a7aa768165ef570f1d2ab1018f4d6b4ce26128c54c576fbdb1a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nlet aspectRatio = CGSize(width: 1920, height: 1080)\nplayerLayer.frame = AVMakeRect(aspectRatio: aspectRatio, insideRect: superLayer.bounds)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nlet aspectRatio = CGSize(width: 1920, height: 1080)\nplayerLayer.frame = AVMakeRect(aspectRatio: aspectRatio, insideRect: superLayer.bounds)\n```",
      "sourceHash": "28b8a778608d87fa92a689c22862353b93c94d9ff55be96829003ea520219e34",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0013:0001",
      "source": "**Objective-C**:",
      "ko": "**Objective-C**:",
      "sourceHash": "b9ff84054868fd0b6412772e8cea2685d76cc712077d6834ad09a26b49b31897",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0014:0001",
      "source": "```objc\nCGSize aspectRatio = CGSizeMake(1920, 1080);\nself.playerLayer.frame = AVMakeRectWithAspectRatioInsideRect(aspectRatio, self.superLayer.bounds);\n```",
      "ko": "```objc\nCGSize aspectRatio = CGSizeMake(1920, 1080);\nself.playerLayer.frame = AVMakeRectWithAspectRatioInsideRect(aspectRatio, self.superLayer.bounds);\n```",
